[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.3[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]Keep knees and thighs intact in the slow walk on outfits whose legs are proportioned differently from the game's own rig. The game's foot IK now solves with the worn body's leg lengths for outfits that opt in, while keeping its ground and stair adaptation.
[*]The first outfit to opt in is eins0fx's new Proxima outfit (id eins0fx.thornyproxima, v0.1.0). Every other outfit, original shells, NPC and enemy looks and non-CSS replacement mods keep the game's foot IK exactly as in 1.0.2.
[/list]

[b]CSS Shared Assets 1.0.3[/b]
[list]
[*]Support shared animations and facial playback for eins0fx's new Proxima outfit v0.1.0. Every other outfit keeps the support it had in 1.0.2.
[/list]

[b]Upgrading[/b]
[list]
[*]Close the game and replace the CustomShellSystem folder with CSS 1.0.3. Keep CustomShellSystem/state and your profiles.
[*]Replace CSS_SharedAssets_P under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/ with CSS Shared Assets 1.0.3.
[*]Nothing else changes for outfits you already have installed.
[/list]
